---
import LinkButton from './LinkButton.astro';
---
<section class="home-hero page-width" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Kai Takeuchi · Product strategy & development</p>
  <h1 id="hero-title"><span class="hero-title-line"><span data-hero-line>Healthcare + AI</span></span><span class="hero-title-line"><em data-hero-line>Product Leader<svg class="hero-flourish" width="420" height="14" viewBox="0 0 420 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path data-hero-flourish d="M2 9C99 2 239 1 417 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></em></span></h1>
  <div class="hero-bottom">
    <div class="hero-intro">
      <p>I build products around the complexity of healthcare: the workflows, the data, and the people making decisions.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><LinkButton href="/work/" variant="solid">Explore my work</LinkButton><LinkButton href="/about/">A little about me</LinkButton></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-note" aria-label="Current role">
      <span class="eyebrow">Currently</span>
      <p>Principal Product Manager<br /><strong>Syneos Health</strong></p>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-topics" aria-label="Areas of focus"><span>Healthcare workflows</span><span>0-to-1 products</span><span>Applied AI</span></div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-title-line { display: block; }
  [data-hero-line] { display: inline-block; position: relative; }
  .hero-flourish { position: absolute; bottom: -.12em; left: 0; width: 100%; height: .17em; opacity: .55; pointer-events: none; }
</style>
